<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 846-4 AT TEA V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 846-4 AT TEA V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, replying to India's first innings score of 537-8 declared, were 846-4 at tea on the fifth and final day of the first test on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 1st innings 537-8 declared; Sri Lanka 1st innings (S.Jayasuriya 340, R.Mahanama 225, A.de Silva 91 not out).</p>
